# Materials for cube.obj: one colour per face. Kd is the colour, Ks the
# specular strength (kept for the specular experiment; unused by Lambert).
newmtl front
Kd 0.9 0.2 0.2
Ks 0.3 0.3 0.3

newmtl back
Kd 0.2 0.9 0.2

newmtl right
Kd 0.2 0.2 0.9

newmtl left
Kd 0.9 0.9 0.2

newmtl top
Kd 0.9 0.9 0.9

newmtl bottom
Kd 0.3 0.3 0.3
